{"type":"message","id":"0fc9b1f4","parentId":"6b888e95","timestamp":"2026-04-02T09:13:23.456Z","message":{"role":"user","content":[{"type":"text","text":"[cron:e8cb043b-3b0e-4316-bfae-60c4a85156c5 微信通知监听-自动处理] 【定时检查-微信未读处理】当前时间：{{current_time}}\n工作目录：/Users/chongya/.openclaw/workspace/agents/after-sales\n\n步骤1：检查微信 Dock Badge\n执行：osascript -e 'tell application \"System Events\" to get badge value of application process \"WeChat\"'\n- 返回空 or missing value → 无未读，直接结束\n- 返回数字 → 有未读，继续\n\n步骤2：获取未读候选列表（不激活微信）\n  cd /Users/chongya/.openclaw/workspace/agents/after-sales\n  bash scripts/mac_wechat_handle_unread_groups_once.sh --out-dir exports --max-steps 10\n- 返回 candidates，每个含 screen_x, screen_y（已换算好的屏幕坐标）\n- candidates 为空 → 直接结束\n\n步骤3：激活微信到前台（只做一次）\n  open -a WeChat && sleep 1.5\n- 等微信完全出现在最前面\n\n步骤4：批量处理（前5个 candidates）\n对每个 candidate 执行：\n  4a. 点击对话（用 screen_x/screen_y，不是 cx/cy）：\n      bash scripts/mac_wechat_control.sh --action click --x {screen_x} --y {screen_y}\n  4b. 等待加载：sleep 1.5\n  4c. 截图读取内容：bash scripts/mac_wechat_control.sh --action read_latest --out-dir exports\n  4d. 分析截图，识别发送者和消息内容，判断客户意图\n  4e. 查知识库（如需要）：python3 /Users/chongya/Desktop/fuiou_knowledge_base/search_index.py 关键词\n  4f. 参考 knowledge/dialogue_scripts.md 选择话术\n  4g. 按 knowledge/message_format.md 排版回复\n  4h. 发送回复：bash scripts/mac_wechat_control.sh --action send_text --text \"回复内容\"\n\n步骤5：结束，无需操作任何文件\nCurrent time: Thursday, April 2nd, 2026 — 5:13 PM (Asia/Shanghai)\n\nReturn your summary as plain text; it will be delivered automatically. If the task explicitly calls for messaging a specific external recipient, note who/where it should go instead of sending it yourself."}],"timestamp":1775121203454}}
